  "source_text": "[i_PI_SabineFirehand]I wish I could have been there, fighting beside you in the darkest hours of our then uncertain fate...\r\n\r\nBut such was not my destiny.  No, it was yours alone; to triumph where no one before you was able and to seal the glory of our future.",
